        "answer": {
          "short": "$y=-\\frac12x+3$",
          "worked": "The perpendicular gradient is the negative reciprocal.\n$$\\begin{align*}m_{\\mathrm{orig}}&=2\\\\m_{\\mathrm{perp}}&=-\\frac12\\\\c_{\\mathrm{perp}}&=3\\\\y&=-\\frac12x+3\\end{align*}$$",
